  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ef92c4e9-2e74-46e3-96f8-4a72b5c250ee-image.png\" style=\"width: 346px; height: 240px;\" /></p><p>Co-ordinates of focus of parabola will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>Now, length of latus-rectum&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>.</p><p>So,&nbsp;length of semi latus-rectum&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>.</p><p>Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p><p>Now, radius of circle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Now, applying pythagoras theorem in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#9651;</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>16</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math>.</p>",
